    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d959-a1">

                <pb facs="0922" n="824" xml:id="pg824"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bingham to Mr. Merry</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Juan del Norte, Nicaragua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                13, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor of informing you that to-day I have received authorization from
                    the minister of foreign affairs to return to the American merchants, residents
                    of Bluefields, the amounts deposited with me in conformity with the agreement
                    between yourself and Mr. Minister Sanson.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bingham</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
